=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
hardn  v0.4.0              https://github.com/abbott/hardn$
$
  hardn > User Management > Manage User$
$
  Managing sudo method for: [george]$
$
# [*] Warning$
# A user password is required for sudo usage.$
$
# User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Sudo Method          Password required$
$
   -  Require george's password for sudo$
      /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-george$
      @@ -1 +1 @@$
      -george ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL$
      +george ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL$
      $ visudo -cf /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-george$
$
   -  Check the sudo configuration$
      $ visudo -c$
$
  Require password for sudo? [y/N, 0, b or q]: y$

